{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01232",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.29,
      "end_seconds": 3.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Afternoon, thanks for coming in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.21,
      "end_seconds": 6.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.24,
      "text": "Evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 8.23,
      "end_seconds": 10.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Doctor, thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.89,
      "end_seconds": 18.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.99,
      "text": "Alright, yes, that's no problem at all. Please sit. Lovely day outside, isn't it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 20.74,
      "end_seconds": 25.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "It is, I almost forgot I was coming here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.33,
      "end_seconds": 29.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "What would you like to start with today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.75,
      "end_seconds": 34.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I'm, I'm here because of night sweats."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.54,
      "end_seconds": 39.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 40.42,
      "end_seconds": 48.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "She is on alendronate, 70 milligrams, once a week, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.39,
      "end_seconds": 53.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "When was the first time you noticed it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.85,
      "end_seconds": 58.45,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Probably about three months. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.61,
      "end_seconds": 68.8,
      "duration_seconds": 9.19,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.6,
      "end_seconds": 78.56,
      "duration_seconds": 7.96,
      "text": "It happens every other day. Maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.48,
      "end_seconds": 83.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Has there been mood swings too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.89,
      "end_seconds": 92.3,
      "duration_seconds": 7.41,
      "text": "Yes, um, for nearly five years. With mood swings, I'd say moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.24,
      "end_seconds": 113.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Have you noticed heavy bleeding, weight loss or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.0,
      "end_seconds": 119.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "No heavy bleeding, weight loss or chest pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.56,
      "end_seconds": 123.69,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Have you noticed palpitations or bleeding after sex?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.62,
      "end_seconds": 127.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, none of those at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.18,
      "end_seconds": 132.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "How are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.98,
      "end_seconds": 135.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.2,
      "end_seconds": 142.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.13,
      "text": "So, what conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.15,
      "end_seconds": 145.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "I have thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.86,
      "end_seconds": 149.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.81,
      "end_seconds": 169.15,
      "duration_seconds": 18.34,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I live with my elderly mother. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.72,
      "end_seconds": 183.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Any past operations I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.91,
      "end_seconds": 195.73,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "Ah, I had a meniscus repair on my knee four years ago. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.17,
      "end_seconds": 207.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.2,
      "end_seconds": 212.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.12,
      "end_seconds": 217.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.63,
      "end_seconds": 222.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Alright, take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.82,
      "end_seconds": 245.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.0,
      "text": "Blood pressure and pulse are fine and there are no breast lumps on examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.4,
      "end_seconds": 262.98,
      "duration_seconds": 11.58,
      "text": "That's all I needed to check. Okay, thinking it through, the most likely explanation is perimenopausal symptoms. An overactive thyroid is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.54,
      "end_seconds": 266.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.26,
      "end_seconds": 278.69,
      "duration_seconds": 10.43,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with perimenopausal symptoms do well once it's treated properly. I'd like to arrange blood tests for hot flushes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.71,
      "end_seconds": 282.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "Is that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 284.67,
      "end_seconds": 306.97,
      "duration_seconds": 22.3,
      "text": "Layers of clothing, a fan by the bed, and cutting down on caffeine and spicy food can help the flushes. If it hasn't settled in a month, we'd think about a bone density scan, but not now. I'll want another look in three months. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.75,
      "end_seconds": 311.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}